# 5. Git Basic Workflow

| Stage             | Command           | Purpose                   |
| ----------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------- |
| Working Directory | Edit/create files | Make changes              |
| Check changes     | `git status`      | See current state         |
| Stage changes     | `git add`         | Select changes for commit |
| Commit            | `git commit`      | Save staged changes       |
| View history      | `git log`         | Review commits            |

### Complete Workflow

```text
Working Directory
       ↓
   git status
       ↓
    git add
       ↓
 Staging Area
       ↓
   git commit
       ↓
   Repository
       ↓
    git log
```

