# 8. Commit Changes

```bash
git commit -m "first commit"
```

### Meaning

| Part             | Meaning                   |
| ---------------- | ------------------------- |
| `git`            | Git command               |
| `commit`         | Create a commit           |
| `-m`             | Provide commit message    |
| `"first commit"` | Description of the change |

### Good Commit Message Examples

```bash
git commit -m "add git commands reference"
