# 10. View Commit History

### Detailed History

```bash
git log
```

Shows information such as:

| Information    | Description                 |
| -------------- | --------------------------- |
| Commit ID      | Unique identifier of commit |
| Author         | Person who created commit   |
| Date           | Commit date                 |
| Commit message | Description of change       |

### Compact History

```bash
git log --oneline
```

Example:

```text
a1b2c3d adding git log --oneline command
d4e5f6g adding git log command
h7i8j9k adding restore command
x1y2z3a first commit
```

