# 🎯 Day 22 – Final Takeaway

> **Git tracks changes over time by storing commits in a repository. The staging area gives me control over which changes I want to include in the next commit.**

### My Git Mental Model

```text
Working Directory
       ↓
    git add
       ↓
 Staging Area
       ↓
  git commit
       ↓
 Repository
       ↓
    git log
```

### One-Line Interview Answer

**Git is a distributed version control system that tracks changes to files and allows developers to manage project history through commits.**
